Description:

Experimental formula, obtained doing two different formulas subsequently;

1) Power 4 Sine Bulb formula, without adding C;
2) Power 2 Azimuthal, adding C. (Total power; 2 x 4 = 8)

Azimuthal formula by bugman; 
http://www.fractalforums.com/theory/3d-mandelbrot-formula-based-on-rotation-away-from-azimuthal-axis/

It has interesting features and it looks different from the original bulbs.